- `cargo test --offline --locked -p rocketmq-classic-protocol --all-features` — passed (160 unit tests, all integration tests, and 166 doctests).
- `cargo clippy --offline --locked -p rocketmq-classic-protocol --all-targets --all-features -- -D warnings` — passed.
- `mvn -q -o -f compat/java-reference/pom.xml verify` — passed; 37 scenarios, 11 message fixtures, 106 typed headers, and 19 typed bodies verified.
- `cargo fmt --all -- --check` and `git diff --check` — passed.
- No push or remote CI was run; existing Phase 19 user-owned paths were not edited or staged.

This closes the Lite request-header mapping gap only. Broad P18-V01 remains
PARTIAL; native Windows runtime and current-revision remote Ubuntu CI remain
open, and Phase 19 Broker/Docker work remains outside scope.
